  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "The presidential election was finally settled. Drink makers chased new markets, and scientists studied signs of ancient water on Mars.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "Similar brands could take different paths. The international share basket added businesses outside the US, with different opportunities, risks and currencies.",
    "what_faded_away": "A new drink deal or a year-end economic prediction could not settle the five-year ranking. The story continued long after the headlines changed.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "Nobody knew the exact company outcomes or the shocks ahead. A familiar household product was not a guarantee against losing money.",
